                                "sense_id": "68d2cde2-550a-37fb-bc42-265de8c7ae21",
                                "text": "He had a set of chains in his room that he said he used with his psychoanalyst; they were experimenting with narcoanalysis and found that Old Bull had seven separate personalities, each growing worse and worse on the way down, till finally he was a raving idiot and had to be restrained with chains."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
